 <h3><u>Qaid khane se sakina ki ye aati thi sada</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye sakina, haaye sakina<br> haye sakina</p> 
  <p>Haye...haaye...<br> Samajh ke zahra sataya gaya sakina ko<br> qadam qadam pe rulaya gaya sakina ko<br> wo zakhm aaj bhi taaza hai pushte naaqa se<br> haye giri nahi hai giraya gaya sakina ko<br> haye... haye</p> 
  <p>Qaid khane se sakina ki ye aati thi sada<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>Mujhko chalte hue naaqe se giraya baba<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>Hogayi chaar(4) baras mein hi sakina, zahra<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>Qaid khane se sakina ki ye aati thi sada<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>1. Wo bhi dada se chupati rahi apna pehlu<br> mujhse bhi dekhe na jayenge ali ke aasu..(2)<br> jeeteji mere mera zakhm na dekhe bhaiyya<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>2. Kaise aayi hu mai bazaar se hokar baba<br> mujhko maare gaye is zakhm pe patthar baba..(2)<br> roke mai kehti rahi phir bhi kisi ne na suna<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>3. Haye,<br> Ab samajh sakti hu kis tarha wo soti hongi<br> haath pehlu pe rakhe kaise tadapti hongi<br> karwate dard mujhe bhi nahi lene deta<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>4. Hubahu fatima zehra si zaeefi chayi<br> jhurriya'n chehre pe baalo mein safedi aayi..(2)<br> ek kami baaqi thi wo bhi hui poori baba<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>5. Saath suraj ke ye dil doob raha hota hai<br> amma kehti hai yehi waqt e dua hota hai..(2)<br> roz karti hu sare shaam mai marne ki dua<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>6. Jaake jannat mein bhi aaram nahi payega<br> kya ye armaan mera dil mein hi reh jayega<br> kaise godi mein uthaungi mai asghar ko bhala<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>7. Aapka sar jale daaman mein uthane ke liye<br> haath darbaar mein mushkil se uthaye maine<br> tumko us waqt bhi maine na bataya baba<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>8. Gir padi khaak pe namoos e nabi peet ke sarr<br> qaid khane mein hui aur qayamat akbar<br> leke sar baap ka bachhi ne jo ro ro ke kaha<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha</p> 
  <p>Qaid khane se sakina ki ye aati thi sada<br> pasliya'n toot gayi meri bhi dadi ki tarha<br> Haye zahra, haye sakina</p> 
